               role = c("aut"),
               email = "wilke@data-connection.de")
    )
Description: An R package to use commands in Excel files 
    to generate crosstabs of labelled data sets (usually survey data).
    The crosstabs can be printed to the console,
    and serve as an input for an app to plot them interactively.
